@host = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@mail.com
@password = rahasia123

# isi pakai "token" dari response request no. 2 (login)
@token = ISI_TOKEN_DISINI

### 1. Register (lewati kalau udah punya akun)
POST {{host}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2. Login -> copy nilai "token" ke variabel @token di atas
POST {{host}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Lihat profile
GET {{host}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Upload foto profile (field namanya "photo", file harus ada di folder yang sama dengan file .http ini)
POST {{host}}/api/profile/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BatasUpload

------BatasUpload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="foto.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./foto.png
------BatasUpload--
